# =============================================================================
# Diligently — desktop (Tauri) environment
# =============================================================================
#
# Copy to `.env` in this same folder (diligent/src-tauri/.env). `scripts/setup`
# does this for you. Fill in the keys, then start the app (`npm run tauri dev`).
# `.env` is gitignored — commit only `.env.example`.
#
# Bring your own keys — the app talks directly to the providers, never to a
# hosted service. Two providers, each with a distinct job:
#
#   Anthropic (Claude) -> quick chat + screenshot / vision
#   DeepSeek           -> job & Upwork generation (CV, JD, cover letter, proposals)
#
# DeepSeek is used for generation because it is far cheaper per token at
# comparable quality on these structured tasks; Claude keeps the chat and does
# the image understanding, which DeepSeek is weaker at.

# =============================================================================
# Anthropic (Claude) — quick chat + screenshots (REQUIRED)
# =============================================================================
#   1. Sign up at https://console.anthropic.com/ (separate from a claude.ai plan)
#   2. Add billing / prepay credits (minimum $5)
#   3. Settings -> API Keys -> Create Key, copy the sk-ant-api03-... value
# Model IDs: claude-sonnet-4-6 (default) or claude-haiku-4-5-20251001 (cheaper/faster).
#
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6

# =============================================================================
# DeepSeek — job & Upwork generation (REQUIRED for the Job Copilot)
# =============================================================================
#   1. Sign up at https://platform.deepseek.com/
#   2. Top up a small balance (usage here is cents per application)
#   3. API keys -> create key, copy the sk-... value
#
# NOTE: the app sends "thinking": {"type": "disabled"} for these calls. DeepSeek's
# thinking mode adds 10-30s per call and spends the output budget on reasoning,
# which truncates the structured JSON these generators depend on. Leave the model
# below as-is unless you know you want something different.
#
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek-v4-pro

# =============================================================================
# Tavily Search — company research ("Research" tab; Rust `web_search`) — OPTIONAL
# =============================================================================
#   1. Sign up free at https://app.tavily.com/ (no card required)
#   2. Copy the API key (it starts with `tvly-`)
# Free tier ~1,000 credits/month; ~2 queries per research run. Read at runtime,
# so no rebuild is needed after setting it — just restart the app.
#
TAVILY_API_KEY=
